Our attempt to cross the room ú impeded by an unob-
served footstool, but our ¤ existed nevertheless.
The ¤ of each second contributes to á of
the minute of which it is part, just as each minute gives its
bit of life ¦ hour, ª hour ¦ day. And so, ¯
end, » a ¤ for every life.I
