likely ř man running for his life would even see the
blind man, let alone help him. And, certainly, a ruthless
killer ë more likely to shoot the blind man for
getting ½ way than ś kindly gestures toward him.
Transition Ä present ś even a three-dimensional
character believable. The lack of transition produces melo-
drama.
