ABOUT THE AUTHOR
Lajos Egri was born some sixty years ago £
city of Eger, Hungary, and wrote his first three-act
play ¯ age of ten. For more than thirty-five
years è written and directed plays in Europe
ª United States. He was director ¡ Egri
School of Writing in New York City for many
years. He now resides in Los Angeles, California,
where he is teaching and working with members
¡ film industry.
